{"id":"conmocio_n","lemma":"conmoción","pos":"noun","rank":4471,"glosses":["commotion, agitation","concussion"],"ipa":"/kommoˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"conmociones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-conmoci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Causó cierta conmoción.","en":"It caused quite a commotion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801242","words":[{"g":"to cause, to make","l":"causar"},{"g":"a certain, a specific","l":"cierto"},null]},{"text":"Yo no entiendo en realidad a qué viene toda la conmoción.","en":"I really don't understand what all the commotion is about.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"I don't understand"],[3,5,"actually"]]},{"text":"La familia sufrió una conmoción cuando la abuela murió inesperadamente.","en":"The family was shook up when the grandmother died unexpectedly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635425","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"family"},{"g":"to suffer","l":"sufrir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"when"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"grandmother"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"unexpectedly"}]},{"text":"Tom pudo oír una conmoción frente a su casa, así que salió a ver qué ocurría.","en":"Tom could hear a commotion in front of his house, so he went outside to see what was happening.","words":[null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to hear"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null,{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"house"},null,null,{"g":"to go out","l":"salir"},null,null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"to happen, to occur","l":"ocurrir"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"as opposed to"],[9,11,"so, therefore"],[12,14,"show me!"]]}]}